    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\nThis charming property would suit many purchasers whether you are a first-time buyer, downsizing or looking for a family home. This is a fantastic opportunity to create your dream home in the lush, rolling countryside of Co Meath.\nWith scenic surroundings in the Boyne Valley, and easy access to Dublin and the airport, the property offers both convenience and lifestyle appeal. An ideal setting for discerning purchasers seeking character, community, and connectivity with the N2, M2 & M3 within easy reach.\nOn approx. 1 acre with outbuilding and detached shed, this rare property offers excellent country living close also to Slane, Navan, Drogheda and Ashbourne.\nThe property benefits from light filled accommodation extending to 88 sq. m. Accommodation comprises entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, three bedrooms and bathroom. Nicely set back on its site of 1 acre. \nEarly viewing is advisable!"
      },
